cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TwinLLM in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TwinLLM: open models over coded health data, with every number traced to its source"
abstract: >-
  A research application for asking questions about wearable, body-scan and
  synthetic cohort data with open language models. Answers are built from closed,
  audited query tools over coded FHIR R4 observations, several models can answer
  side by side, and every answer shows the data it used. Part of the Open Science
  Foundation's open-twin work.
